# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CVE corpus. One self-contained translation unit per real-world integer-fault
# CVE, grouped into per-CWE subdirectories: each proves the native computation
# silently produces the wrong value and that the identical boost::safe_numbers
# computation detects the fault. Machine-readable metadata lives in a
# BOOST_SAFE_NUMBERS_CVE_BEGIN/END comment block at the top of every file;
# analysis/aggregate.py aggregates it into per-CWE prevention rates. Basenames
# embed the CVE id so they are globally unique.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CWE-190
